{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vanessa and Sally Plan a Party", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Social Butterfly", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 10, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 16, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Talking About Future Actions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You can use four different tenses to talk about the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<ul><li>When you talk about voluntary actions and promises or threats, you use the future with <span class=\"italic\">will</span>. You use <span class=\"italic\">will</span> when you make a decision at the moment of speaking.</li>  <li>You use <span class=\"italic\">going to</span> for future plans, and for predictions based on evidence in the present situation.</li>  <li>When you talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future, you use the Present Continuous tense.</li>  <li>When you talk about schedules or timetables in the future, you use the Simple Present tense.</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I'll pack some leftovers for Luther. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What is he going to do there? \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He's leaving in the next couple of days. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Simple Present tense</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I have an interview at 10 tomorrow.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Respond Politely to Suggestions and Offers", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When someone offers suggestions, it is important to respond politely.<br><br>Remember to use the modals <span class=\"italic\">could</span>, <span class=\"italic\">should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">might</span> to suggest something.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " Here is a list of expressions you can use to give suggestions:<br>  <ul><li>You might want to \u2026</li> <li>Would you mind \u2026 ?</li> <li>You should \u2026</li> <li>You ought to \u2026 (strong request)</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Offering Suggestions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Responding to Offers and Suggestions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Would you like \u2026 ?</li><li>Can I get you \u2026 ?</li><li>Would you mind \u2026 ?</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>I don't think I can \u2026</li> <li>I guess that could ...</li> <li>That would be \u2026</li> <li>I would \u2026</li> <li>Don't mind if I do!</li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Would you like me to share some of my tricks?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>:  Perhaps \u2026 I would definitely get more chefs to reveal their secrets that way!", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear in a conversation about people's behavior and personality.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "helping ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "serving; portion ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Luther had 3 helpings of poutine.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "praise ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "compliment ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: That's high praise, if you ask me!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "curious ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "eager to know something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: I'm curious about everything!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "nosy", "type": "name"}, {"content": "showing too much interest about other people's lives ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I think you sound a bit nosy sometimes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "wide-eyed ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " having one's eyes wide open in amazement; naive", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: People often think I'm wide-eyed and innocent!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "demeanor ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "behavior", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: My wide-eyed demeanor gets me many interviews!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "convincing ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "persuasive ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I guess you're extremely convincing, then.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob10aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to fool ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to trick or deceive someone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: I let my wide-eyed demeanor fool everyone.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob10aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Think of three professions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Think about the personality you need to have to have a job in that profession.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 4 adjectives that would describe that profession.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Would you like to have one of these jobs?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Talk about the professions with your partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":5,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">profession\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">adjective 1\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">adjective 2\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">adjective 3\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">adjective 4\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about personality and behavior.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe what is necessary.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about plans for the future.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn6le16ob10re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le16ob10re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: This little party is going quite well! I think the pulled pork and poutine were a success.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You bet! Luther had three helpings. You know what he said to me? He'll try poutine every day when he goes to Canada. That's high praise, if you ask me! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What is he going to do there?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: He has a few shows lined up. He's leaving in the next couple of days."}, {"image": "engenn6le16ob10re2img06.jpg", "time": "20000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: How do you know all this? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You know me, V. I'm a social butterfly! I'm always curious.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I just think you sound a bit nosy sometimes ...<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Don't worry about that! I let my wide-eyed demeanor fool everyone.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I guess you're extremely convincing, then."}, {"image": "engenn6le16ob10re2img08.jpg", "time": "35000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: For sure. I get a lot of interviews that way! Would you like me to share some of my tricks?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Perhaps ... I would definitely get more chefs to reveal their secrets that way!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That's very cunning. I like that!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Anyway, I'll pack some leftovers for Luther before he leaves.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'll give them to him. I have an interview at 10 tomorrow."}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le16ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le16ob10re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can talk about people's behavior and personality. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about future actions, plans and intentions. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can respond politely to suggestions and offers.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Have you ever been to a party that you didn't like? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "How was it? Why didn't you like it?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "  What were the other guests like? Describe them.", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"conte